"value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-12T01:07:21-08:00","id":1528409,"title":"","content":"<b>Alternative Trinity Timeline</b> - So in my proposed (later Aberrant era) timeline, in 2024 year war in Ukraine, i.e. Russian Invasion, <b>ended in April 2024 with Ukraine sudden conteroffensive acces to EU</b>. ( I wrote it in 2022, at start of real world ) Now, IRL 2024, war is not nearing end in January 2024 - and Sweden and Finland are really preperaing to possible Russia attack. How to change fan timeline then? Move end of war to years 2026-28? Or went with FULL World War in 2024-25 BEFORE Nova Era? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> ( Doing timeline without proper Nova Era would make problem in <b>Aeon</b>, as there would no Nova/Aberrant descrimination in setting, when the Baselines made 3rd World War, no Novas... )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/world/swedens-defense-ministry-warning-to-brace-for-war-sends-public-into-panic/ar-AA1mObjm\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/world/swedens-defense-ministry-warning-to-brace-for-war-sends-public-into-panic/ar-AA1mObjm\" target=\"_blank\"> MSN </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/world/swedens-defense-ministry-warning-to-brace-for-war-sends-public-into-panic/ar-AA1mObjm\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/world/swedens-defense-ministry-warning-to-brace-for-war-sends-public-into-panic/ar-AA1mObjm </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-13T08:32:36-08:00","id":1528485,"title":"","content":"Since N-Day happened in 2018, it\u2019s very likely that in the Aberrant universe there never was a Russia-Ukraine war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}